              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Nebukadinesa aloma ali, “Wele owa Shaduraka, Meshaka ne Abedineko afume! Orumire malaika wewe khuonia bakholi bewe, babamusuubila. Baloba lilaka lio mwami mala beana babeene, khukhila ne basaaya ne khukholela wele yesi yesi okhali Wele wabwe yeng'ene tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
